                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Definitely recommend!\n\nPros\n.Delightful story\n.Fantasy atmosphere\n.Lovely clear artwork/graphics/scenes\n.Complimenting music/sounds/voice acting (the music in the bonus chapter is absolutely gorgeous!)\n.Four difficulty modes, including custom\n.Mini-map with fast travel\n.Lockable toolbar\n.Gears appear when objects in position for possible use\n.Simple to moderately complex adventure play\n.Assorted types of clever hidden object scenes\n.Collectables (various element sigils)\n.Morphing objects in hidden object scenes\n.Average length\n.Bonus chapter\n\nCons:\n.Mini-puzzles were mainly easy\n\nFinal opinion (7.5):\nIt's a fun romp along an enjoyable, uncomplicated story enhanced by some artful game mechanics and engaging hidden object scenes.",
